[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377846095","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111373#issuecomment-3377846095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111373","id":3377846095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JVddP","user":{"login":"GreentheNinja","id":46876531,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2ODc2NTMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46876531?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja","html_url":"https://github.com/GreentheNinja","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-07T17:25:15Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T17:25:15Z","body":"Uhh, hopefully the name of the commit itself isn't super important. I don't know if I can change that.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377846095/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377974468","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111373#issuecomment-3377974468","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111373","id":3377974468,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JV8zE","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-07T17:55:26Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T17:55:26Z","body":"The problem is that even when using Nearest, interpolation occurs via AnimationTree or AnimationPlayer's crossfades. If you want to completely disable this type of warning, I think the way to go is to add a property to the Editor options that disables warnings.\r\n\r\nOr, perhaps we should prepare a WARN_PRINT_EXPERIMENTAL macro for the entire Godot engine and add an option to the Editor's General section to disable experimental warnings. We should probably discuss this with the Editor or Documentation team. cc @Mickeon @AThousandShips @Calinou ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377974468/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377985724","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111373#issuecomment-3377985724","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111373","id":3377985724,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JV_i8","user":{"login":"GreentheNinja","id":46876531,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2ODc2NTMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46876531?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja","html_url":"https://github.com/GreentheNinja","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-07T17:59:06Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T17:59:06Z","body":"That's a good point, but wouldn't the other track without nearest interpolation trigger the warning? Or do crossfades always run interpolation regardless?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377985724/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377999539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111373#issuecomment-3377999539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111373","id":3377999539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JWC6z","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-07T18:03:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T18:09:57Z","body":"Crossfades always interpolate Nearest track, which is natural. Consider crossfading a Nearest track like modulate/color:alpha of type Float for a clearer example.\r\n\r\nHowever, there is no way to determine whether a crossfade actually occurs, so the warning will be issued even without crossfading.\r\n\r\nThis warning should not appear unless the type is String or StringName. If a warning appears for any other type, it is a bug and should be reported.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377999539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3378102542","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111373#issuecomment-3378102542","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111373","id":3378102542,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JWcEO","user":{"login":"GreentheNinja","id":46876531,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2ODc2NTMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46876531?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja","html_url":"https://github.com/GreentheNinja","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreentheNinja/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-07T18:34:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T12:51:47Z","body":"To elaborate, I made this because I was getting a warning for using a continuous/nearest `StringName` track, which I was using because discrete tracks would seek to the wrong keyframe when playing/seeking backwards. Unless there's some other way to achieve this behavior with a discrete track?\r\n\r\n[The only solution I could find](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/11139) suggested a continuous/nearest track was the intended way to do this, so getting a warning for it is rather annoying.\r\n\r\nIt bugged me enough to edit this into the version of Godot I was using (since I already previously recompiled it to introduce some semi-janky `AnimatedSprite2D` clickable area logic, like what `Sprite2D` has).\r\n\r\nI'm honestly surprised to see that crossfades apply to two nearest interpolated tracks, but I suppose that functionality is probably useful for someone out there. Closing this is probably fair enough, then (though I'll keep it open for a time in case anyone has anything else to add).","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3378102542/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]